Only allow this for an app you trust.␀␀Allow␀␀␀"%s" wants to send PRIVATE messages as you.

It could write to any of your contacts, or post to a room, and the message will look exactly like one you typed.

Only allow this for an app you trust.␀␀␀␀"%s" wants to send discovery probes.

Each probe asks every node in range to reply, so it uses airtime on the whole local mesh, not just yours.

Nothing is sent under your name and no message is transmitted.␀Mark all chats and channels as read?␀␀␀␀Mark read␀␀␀Nothing selected␀␀␀␀Delete %d contact(s)?␀␀␀Purge all discovered nodes?␀Purge␀␀␀Delete this photo?
